            "review_title": "Review at Hai Con Bo Beefsteak",
            "review_text": "Josh Cheah\nSingapore, Singapore66 contributions\n0\nGood food, A/C not turned on\nJun 2017 • Friends\nWe visited during lunchtime and the weather was very hot outside. Thinking that there was A/C we came in, but they turned off the A/C and only had fans pointed at you.\n\nIt was quite stuffy.\n\nOther than that, the meal was decently good for its value. We ordered the steaks, and they were more similar to the hamburg (minced up meat)\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 28, 2017",
